# Notice 등록 요청 

POST http://localhost:9999/api/notices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"연습용제목",
    "writer":"작성자",
    "content":"내용연습"
}

#### Notice 삭제 

DELETE http://localhost:9999/api/notices/2


#### 한건 조회

GET http://localhost:9999/api/notices/3
Accept: application/json


#### 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:9999/api/notices
Accept: application/json

#### 한건 수정
PUT http://localhost:9999/api/notices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"수정용 제목",
    "writer":"작성자수정",
    "content":"내용수정"
}